      "title": "4. Operational Detail — 오류·Pod·수집 상태",
      "collapsed": true,
      "panels": [
        {
          "id": 401,
          "type": "table",
          "title": "선택 구간 HTTP 오류",
          "description": "4xx와 5xx를 Workload·응답코드별로 보여줍니다.",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "gridPos": {
            "x": 0,
            "y": 41,
            "w": 12,
            "h": 9
          },
          "targets": [
            {
              "expr": "sum by(destination_workload,response_code,response_flags) (increase(istio_requests_total{reporter=\"source\",source_workload=\"audio-ingress\",destination_workload_namespace=\"apps\",destination_workload=~\"audio-web|audio-api\",response_code=~\"4..|5..\"}[$__range]))",
              "refId": "A",
              "format": "table",
              "instant": true,
              "range": false
            }
          ],
          "fieldConfig": {
            "defaults": {
              "custom": {
                "align": "auto"
              }
            },
            "overrides": []
          },
          "options": {
            "cellHeight": "sm",
            "showHeader": true,
            "enablePagination": true,
            "footer": {
              "show": false
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": 402,
          "type": "table",
          "title": "Audio Container Restart / OOM",
          "description": "Restart와 최근 OOMKilled가 있는 Container만 표시합니다. 정상 상태에서는 비어 있습니다.",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "gridPos": {
            "x": 12,
            "y": 41,
            "w": 12,
            "h": 9
          },
          "targets": [
            {
              "expr": "sum by(pod,container) (increase(kube_pod_container_status_restarts_total{namespace=\"apps\",pod=~\"audio-.*\"}[$__range])) > 0",
              "refId": "A",
              "format": "table",
              "instant": true,
              "range": false
            },
            {
              "expr": "max by(pod,container,reason) (kube_pod_container_status_last_terminated_reason{namespace=\"apps\",pod=~\"audio-.*\",reason=\"OOMKilled\"} == 1)",
              "refId": "B",
              "format": "table",
              "instant": true,
              "range": false
            }
          ],
          "fieldConfig": {
            "defaults": {
              "custom": {
                "align": "auto"
              }
            },
